{"title":"IAFOR Collaborates in Celebration of Marco Polo","link":"https://iafor.org/iafor-collaborates-in-celebration-of-marco-polo/","date":1734842031000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-Billion-Marco-Polo-1_1500-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"IAFOR Collaborates in Celebration of Marco Polo\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-Billion-Marco-Polo-1_1500-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-Billion-Marco-Polo-1_1500-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-Billion-Marco-Polo-1_1500-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-Billion-Marco-Polo-1_1500-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-Billion-Marco-Polo-1_1500-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-Billion-Marco-Polo-1_1500-32x32.jpg 32w\" />On Thursday December 19, 2024, Dr Joseph Haldane, Chairman and CEO of IAFOR, attended the Senato della Repubblica (Italian Senate) in Rome to participate in the book launch of the international edition of The Billion, which was recently published by the Dante Alighieri Cultural Association in association with IAFOR.\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/iafor-collaborates-in-celebration-of-marco-polo/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"9488c9e857958ad880a6ecbd3313478a81068a71c678ea6ab85034a96570cdc4","category":"Interdisciplinary"}